# The kernel tree is compiled by Kbuild and applied by patch(1); neither
# tolerates CRLF. A Makefile with CRLF fails on the first variable assignment,
# and a patch with CRLF is rejected as corrupt. Store these bytes verbatim,
# whatever core.autocrlf says.
kernel/source/** -text

# Shell scripts are pushed to the device and run there, where a trailing CR
# becomes part of the command name. Keep them LF everywhere.
*.sh text eol=lf

# 随包载荷与音频是二进制，行尾转换会把字节改掉。
*.ko.gz binary
*.wav binary
# Python 脚本在 CI 与本机之间来回，统一 LF。
*.py text eol=lf

# 随包载荷与音频是二进制：CRLF 转换会改变字节，载荷哈希就全错了（P1-22 的门禁）。
*.ko.gz binary
*.wav binary
*.py text eol=lf
*.png binary
